                <!-- The detail pane's description body (ref SkillDetailDescriptionText, l.579-591:
                     GameFontHighlightSmall, 275 wide, justified LEFT/TOP). The ref hangs it inside
                     its SkillDetailScrollChildFrame; this page's flat layout (header comment) has
